    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Indian Banks’ Association (IBA) approved consignment bilty is essential for the transport of your vehicle. This document serves as a receipt and proof of the agreement between you and the transport service provider.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>In addition to these documents, it is highly recommended to opt for <strong>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</strong>. This type of insurance provides comprehensive coverage for your vehicle during transit, ensuring that you are fully compensated for any damages or losses incurred while your vehicle is being transported.</p>
<p>By declaring the full value of your car, you can have peace of mind knowing that your investment is safeguarded throughout the transportation process.</p>

<p>In conclusion, having the right paperwork in order can make your car transportation experience in Pharenda, Maharajganj, hassle-free. Ensure that you have all the necessary documents and consider marine transit insurance for additional protection.</p></div>
